{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/formal-ai/pulls/424","id":3853168225,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSbOoU87lqq5h","html_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/pull/424","diff_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/pull/424.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/link-assistant/formal-ai/pull/424.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/formal-ai/issues/424","number":424,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Support README install guide script conversion","user":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- Added deterministic README/install guide conversion between Markdown guides, `sh` scripts, and PowerShell scripts in the Rust solver and browser worker.\n- Added an explicit meta-algorithm trace for constructing this class of algorithm: problem corpus -> surface ontology -> shared IR -> recognizers/renderers/validators -> verification fixtures -> runtime mirrors.\n- Connected the same meta-algorithm to existing coding surfaces (`coding_catalog`, `program_synthesis`, `program_blueprint`, `numeric_list`, `rule_synthesis`, and `installation_conversion`) in the rendered answer, formal meaning, and event evidence.\n- Doubled the popular GitHub project regression matrix from 50 to 100 cases and refreshed the archived case-study snapshot.\n\n## Reproduction\n\nBefore this change, prompts asking to convert README installation instructions to scripts, scripts back to README guides, or to expose the algorithm-construction layer routed to generic/unknown paths and did not preserve a reusable conversion trace.\n\nThe regression coverage now includes:\n\n- README Markdown guide -> Bash and PowerShell scripts.\n- Shell and PowerShell install scripts -> README guide.\n- Nested fenced README examples.\n- Meta-algorithm trace assertions.\n- 100 popular GitHub repository conversion prompts.\n- Browser worker parity checks.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `cargo fmt -- --check`\n- `node --check src/web/formal_ai_worker.js`\n- `cargo test --test unit installation_conversion -- --nocapture`\n- `node experiments/issue-423-js-installation-conversion.mjs`\n- `cargo test --test unit`\n- `cargo test --test source`\n- `cargo test --test integration`\n- `cargo clippy --all-targets --all-features`\n- `rust-script scripts/check-file-size.rs` (passes; existing warning-band files only)\n\n\n\nFixes #423","created_at":"2026-06-12T08:04:50Z","updated_at":"2026-06-13T09:26:41Z","closed_at":"2026-06-13T09:26:40Z","merged_at":"2026-06-13T09:26:40Z","merge_commit_sha":"b089f5bfc1b191ce56d1db4fa90af42c31323fa2","assignees":[{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard","html_url":"https://github.com/konard","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/konard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"ht